---
import Main from "../layouts/main.astro";
---

<Main title="Charlotte's projects :3">
  <div class="bg-background/40 w-full flex-row rounded-xl p-4 backdrop-blur-2xl md:w-208">
    <h1 class="mb-2">projects</h1>
    <ul class="mb-2">
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-ctp-green">tadpole</h2>
        <p>tadpole was a lightweight file host with discord authentication, written in astro and typescript. it was released under the mpl 2.0</p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/catgirlpuppy/tadpole"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-ctp-subtext0 hover:text-ctp-green underline underline-offset-2"
        >
          source
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-ctp-red">nestrec</h2>
        <p>nestrec is a hardware and software <span class="font-bold">rec</span>reation of the google <span class="font-bold">nest</span> hub, intended to be more private. i hope that once i finish it, i can make it open source! but, like everything, i'm held back by cost of parts.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-ctp-sapphire">
          <a
            href="https://charlotte.is-my.dog"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            cimd-profile
          </a>
        </h2>
        <p>this is my profile website i've been slowly refining over the past year and some. most of the iterations have been astro and tailwind, and have all had very different designs.</p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/catgirlpuppy/cimd-profile"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-ctp-subtext0 hover:text-ctp-sapphire underline underline-offset-2"
        >
          source
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2>...</h2>
        <p>i don't really have any more projects...</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <a
      href="/"
      class="text-ctp-lavender text-lg hover:underline"
    >
      go home
    </a>
  </div>
</Main>
